{%- comment -%}
  cx-price — money display helper for the Cellexia buy box.

  Params:
    cents   (required) integer cents (Liquid variant/allocation prices are cents)
    compare (optional) integer cents; rendered struck-through after the price
                       when strictly greater than `cents`
    class   (optional) extra class list appended to the wrapper span

  Renders nothing when `cents` is blank, so callers can pass through possibly
  missing values without guarding.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if cents != blank -%}
  <span class="cx-price{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}">{{ cents | money }}</span>
  {%- if compare != blank and compare > cents %} <s class="cx-price__compare">{{ compare | money }}</s>{% endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
